  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the High Level Panel of Experts on Food Security and Nutrition (HLPE-FSN) of the Committee on World Food Security (CFS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the HLPE-FSN, including its Secretariat. The objectives are the following:
1-	Supporting the functioning of the HLPE-FSN Secretariat, the HLPE-FSN Steering Committee, HLPE-FSN drafting teams, in line with the guidelines set out in the CFS mandate.
2-	Supporting the preparation of HLPE-FSN reports and notes on critical and emerging issues (CEI) on FSN and other ad hoc papers, as per CFS requests.
3-	Managing and coordinating the outreach, communication and dissemination of results (HLPE-FSN reports) within the CFS and more widely to all stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
